{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the blood-soaked Haunted Lands, a retro-inspired action platformer filled with hidden secrets and hardcore challenges. Choose from six unique characters, each fitting a different playstyle. Delve into perilous burial grounds crawling with evil spirits and nightmarish abominations. Acquire powerful artifacts to confront these horrors and find new ways to approach battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted Lands is a solo-developed project by Alevgor, where every system, encounter, and detail is built by one developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980900/extras/b826f070e96468b1c4a9d76dfffeed9f.poster.avif?t=1773199480\" width=780 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980900/extras/b826f070e96468b1c4a9d76dfffeed9f.webm?t=1773199480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980900/extras/b826f070e96468b1c4a9d76dfffeed9f.mp4?t=1773199480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Heroes:</strong>\u00a0Choose one of six playable characters. Some prefer to demolish monsters from a safe distance, while others excel in close combat. Each has their own abilities and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous Locations:</strong> Explore the ruins of the old crypts and tombs filled with evil spirits and otherworldly monsters. Blast your way through hordes of enemies, their elite versions, and challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Artifacts:</strong>\u00a0Acquire artifacts to enhance your abilities, offering new ways to confront the horrors of the burial grounds. The most powerful items can change your character's skills entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Challenges:</strong>\u00a0Find every secret hidden in the Haunted Lands, complete every objective, and leave behind nothing but corpses. Dare you descend into the very abyss of hell and come back unscathed?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980900/extras/f6e6fd4a4f280360559d77fefbf84e59.apng?t=1773199480\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980900/extras/f6e6fd4a4f280360559d77fefbf84e59.poster.avif?t=1773199480\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=280 /></picture></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Revelation 20:14","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980900/5b637debbe0195340ac921f2098da66c94d017a7.jpg"},{"name":"Thessalonians 5:3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980900/9b113005d9ee79391b4a1280a1eb5150067c9f81.jpg"},{"name":"Galatians 5:20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980900/91acb68d3a6a5942b9b24b18b6ddc66a63b4c7ed.jpg"},{"name":"Press Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980900/92811328af58bd4c3580edd51480b367692ebf42.jpg"},{"name":"The Root of All Evil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980900/c889115c719e6e0e9c6caff5bef2010c62f503ec.jpg"},{"name":"Greed is Good","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980900/db9f500b5251257f7dd5305cf4e18c4638285834.jpg"},{"name":"Vault 101","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980900/a94c3b090507f778a2701ea03873b856d5f8ff59.jpg"},{"name":"Vault Dweller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/